WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Create your professional profile: profession, experience and skills.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Add your CV, qualifications and certificates.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Introduce yourself on video, in German when you are ready.

00:18.000 --> 00:24.000
